   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-apprise-api/compare/v2.0.2-ls6...v2.1.0-ls7",
   "upstream": "## What's Changed\r\nA small release to point against the new Apprise v2.2.0 release\r\n\r\n### :lady_beetle:: Bug Fixes\r\n* Provide APPRISE_API_DESCRIPTION and APPRISE_API_KEYWORDS to templates by @liziye627-design in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/382\r\n* Handle YAML RecursionError if thrown by @caronc in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/384\r\n* Load APPRISE_PLUGIN_PATHS on config UI AppriseAsset paths by @liziye627-design in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/385\r\n\r\n### :heart: Life-Cycle Support\r\n* Remove git from the Docker runtime image by @caronc in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/387\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @liziye627-design made their first contribution in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/382\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/compare/v2.0.2...v2.1.0",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/releases/tag/v2.1.0"
